   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Agroforestry for Sustainable Livelihoods, Biodiversity, and Climate Change (ASILIB-CC) programme initiated by Vi Agroforestry is designed to build capacity of local farmer organisations to deliver services to their members as mandated, improve food and nutrition security, foster sustainable livelihoods, ensure gender equality, and bolster resilience among smallholder farmer families while promoting biodiversity conservation and climate change mitigation.</narrative>
